    "detailed_description": "Next chapter of Christmas Puzzle awaits!<br>Complete matching puzzle levels and create a gingerbread holiday decoration telling the story of Hansel and Gretel's journey.<br><br>Embark on a whimsical adventure and tackle a series of quests to tidy up, decorate, and build a fantastical world inspired by classic fairy tales. From cleaning cookie crumbs to creating a gingerbread house, from building a castle for mischievous witch to the chocolate factory grand opening. <br><br>Solve puzzles, light up decorations, and navigate challenges to guide the characters through their enchanting journey. Creative tasks and a touch of humor promise a magical and visually stunning experience for players of all ages. Get ready for a heartwarming conclusion as the characters find their way home.<br><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>\t225 match-3 levels to play <br></li><li>\tComplete dozens of quests<br></li><li>\tFollow the winter story<br></li><li>\tCreate Hensel and Gretel decoration </li></ul>",
